# Diagnostic: walk Jian from his room out of the inn, logging map id and position (scripted run research).
include boot_from_save
watch u16 0x020B6BE4 map
watch u32 0x020B6CEC route_ptr
peek u32 0x020B6CB4 x0
peek u32 0x020B6CB8 y0
shot w0
press Right 40
peek u32 0x020B6CB4 x1
peek u32 0x020B6CB8 y1
shot w1
press Down,Right 40
peek u32 0x020B6CB4 x2
peek u32 0x020B6CB8 y2
shot w2
press Right 40
peek u32 0x020B6CB4 x3
peek u32 0x020B6CB8 y3
shot w3
press Down 80
wait 120
peek u32 0x020B6CB4 x4
peek u32 0x020B6CB8 y4
shot w4
